    <fields>
        <fullName>FAM__Accounting_Company__c</fullName>
        <deleteConstraint>SetNull</deleteConstraint>
        <deprecated>false</deprecated>
        <description>The accounting company that relates to this asset group. This ensures that transactions are associated with the correct accounting company when your org has more than one accounting company. This field enables you to automatically populate the corresponding Accounting Company field while creating a new asset in this asset group.</description>
        <inlineHelpText>The accounting company that relates to this asset group. This ensures that transactions are associated with the correct accounting company when your org has more than one accounting company. This field enables you to automatically populate the corresponding Accounting Company field while creating a new asset in this asset group.</inlineHelpText>
        <label>Accounting Company</label>
        <referenceTo>c2g__codaCompany__c</referenceTo>
        <relationshipLabel>Asset Groups - Accounting Company</relationshipLabel>
        <relationshipName>FAMAssetGroupsFFAAccountingCompany</relationshipName>
        <required>false</required>
        <trackHistory>false</trackHistory>
        <trackTrending>false</trackTrending>
        <type>Lookup</type>
    </fields>
    <fields>
        <fullName>FAM__Accumulated_Depreciation_GLA__c</fullName>
        <deleteConstraint>SetNull</deleteConstraint>
        <deprecated>false</deprecated>
        <description>The accumulated depreciation general ledger account that relates to this asset group. This field enables you to automatically populate the corresponding Accumulated Depreciation GLA field while creating a new asset in this asset group. This general ledger account is used to reduce the value of the asset on the balance sheet and is credited throughout the depreciation schedule. When the asset is disposed of, the account is debited to write off the depreciation value.</description>
        <inlineHelpText>The accumulated depreciation general ledger account that relates to this asset group. This field enables you to automatically populate the corresponding Accumulated Depreciation GLA field while creating a new asset in this asset group. This general ledger account is used to reduce the value of the asset on the balance sheet and is credited throughout the depreciation schedule. When the asset is disposed of, the account is debited to write off the depreciation value.</inlineHelpText>
        <label>Accumulated Depreciation GLA</label>
        <lookupFilter>
            <active>true</active>
            <booleanFilter>1 OR 2</booleanFilter>
            <filterItems>
                <field>c2g__codaGeneralLedgerAccount__c.c2g__ChartOfAccountsStructure__r.Name</field>
                <operation>equals</operation>
                <value></value>
            </filterItems>
            <filterItems>
                <field>c2g__codaGeneralLedgerAccount__c.c2g__ChartOfAccountsStructure__r.c2g__IsCorporate__c</field>
                <operation>equals</operation>
                <value>True</value>
            </filterItems>
            <isOptional>true</isOptional>
        </lookupFilter>
        <referenceTo>c2g__codaGeneralLedgerAccount__c</referenceTo>
        <relationshipLabel>Asset Groups - Accumulated Depreciation GLA</relationshipLabel>
        <relationshipName>FAMAssetGroupsFFAAccDepreciationGLA</relationshipName>
        <required>false</required>
        <trackHistory>false</trackHistory>
        <trackTrending>false</trackTrending>
        <type>Lookup</type>
    </fields>
    <fields>
        <fullName>FAM__Depreciation_GLA__c</fullName>
        <deleteConstraint>SetNull</deleteConstraint>
        <deprecated>false</deprecated>
        <description>The depreciation general ledger account that relates to this asset group. This field enables you to automatically populate the corresponding Depreciation GLA field while creating a new asset in this asset group. This is the general ledger account to which depreciation is charged for the profit and loss account and is debited during the depreciation schedule.</description>
        <inlineHelpText>The depreciation general ledger account that relates to this asset group. This field enables you to automatically populate the corresponding Depreciation GLA field while creating a new asset in this asset group. This is the general ledger account to which depreciation is charged for the profit and loss account and is debited during the depreciation schedule.</inlineHelpText>
        <label>Depreciation GLA</label>
        <lookupFilter>
            <active>true</active>
            <booleanFilter>1 OR 2</booleanFilter>
            <filterItems>
                <field>c2g__codaGeneralLedgerAccount__c.c2g__ChartOfAccountsStructure__r.Name</field>
                <operation>equals</operation>
                <value></value>
            </filterItems>
            <filterItems>
                <field>c2g__codaGeneralLedgerAccount__c.c2g__ChartOfAccountsStructure__r.c2g__IsCorporate__c</field>
                <operation>equals</operation>
                <value>True</value>
            </filterItems>
            <isOptional>true</isOptional>
        </lookupFilter>
        <referenceTo>c2g__codaGeneralLedgerAccount__c</referenceTo>
        <relationshipLabel>Asset Groups - Depreciation GLA</relationshipLabel>
        <relationshipName>FAMAssetGroupsFFADepreciationGLA</relationshipName>
        <required>false</required>
        <trackHistory>false</trackHistory>
        <trackTrending>false</trackTrending>
        <type>Lookup</type>
    </fields>
    <fields>
        <fullName>FAM__Fixed_Asset_GLA__c</fullName>
        <deleteConstraint>SetNull</deleteConstraint>
        <deprecated>false</deprecated>
        <description>The fixed asset general ledger account that relates to this asset group. This field enables you to automatically populate the corresponding Fixed Asset GLA field while creating a new asset in this asset group. This general ledger account is debited when the asset is acquired and credited when the asset is disposed of. This is normally a balance sheet account.</description>
        <inlineHelpText>The fixed asset general ledger account that relates to this asset group. This field enables you to automatically populate the corresponding Fixed Asset GLA field while creating a new asset in this asset group. This general ledger account is debited when the asset is acquired and credited when the asset is disposed of. This is normally a balance sheet account.</inlineHelpText>
        <label>Fixed Asset GLA</label>
        <lookupFilter>
            <active>true</active>
            <booleanFilter>1 OR 2</booleanFilter>
            <filterItems>
                <field>c2g__codaGeneralLedgerAccount__c.c2g__ChartOfAccountsStructure__r.Name</field>
                <operation>equals</operation>
                <value></value>
            </filterItems>
            <filterItems>
                <field>c2g__codaGeneralLedgerAccount__c.c2g__ChartOfAccountsStructure__r.c2g__IsCorporate__c</field>
                <operation>equals</operation>
                <value>True</value>
            </filterItems>
            <isOptional>true</isOptional>
        </lookupFilter>
        <referenceTo>c2g__codaGeneralLedgerAccount__c</referenceTo>
        <relationshipLabel>Asset Groups - Fixed Asset GLA</relationshipLabel>
